{"id":"torrey:nile-the-river","source":"torrey","name":"Nile, The River","slug":"nile-the-river","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Empties itself into the Mediterranean Sea by seven streams — Isa 11:15.","refs":[["Isa",11,15,11,15]]},{"text":"The river. — Ge 41:1,3.","refs":[["Gen",41,1,41,1],["Gen",41,3,41,3]]},{"text":"The Egyptian sea. — Isa 11:15.","refs":[["Isa",11,15,11,15]]},{"text":"The stream of Egypt. — Isa 27:12.","refs":[["Isa",27,12,27,12]]},{"text":"Sihor. — Jos 13:3; Jer 2:18.","refs":[["Josh",13,3,13,3],["Jer",2,18,2,18]]},{"text":"Crocodiles. — Eze 29:3.","refs":[["Ezek",29,3,29,3]]},{"text":"Fish. — Ex 7:21; Eze 29:4.","refs":[["Exod",7,21,7,21],["Ezek",29,4,29,4]]},{"text":"Reeds and flags. — Isa 19:6,7.","refs":[["Isa",19,6,19,6],["Isa",19,7,19,7]]},{"text":"Annual overflow of its banks alluded to — Jer 46:8; Am 8:8; 9:5.","refs":[["Jer",46,8,46,8],["Amos",8,8,8,8],["Amos",9,5,9,5]]},{"text":"Took great pride in. — Eze 29:9.","refs":[["Ezek",29,9,29,9]]},{"text":"Carried on extensive commerce by. — Isa 23:3.","refs":[["Isa",23,3,23,3]]},{"text":"Bathed in. — Ex 2:5.","refs":[["Exod",2,5,2,5]]},{"text":"Drank of. — Ex 7:21,24.","refs":[["Exod",7,21,7,21],["Exod",7,24,7,24]]},{"text":"Punished by failure of its waters. — Isa 19:5,6.","refs":[["Isa",19,5,19,5],["Isa",19,6,19,6]]},{"text":"Punished by destruction of its fish. — Isa 19:8.","refs":[["Isa",19,8,19,8]]},{"text":"Male children drowned in. — Ex 1:22.","refs":[["Exod",1,22,1,22]]},{"text":"Moses exposed on its banks. — Ex 2:3.","refs":[["Exod",2,3,2,3]]},{"text":"Its waters turned into blood. — Ex 7:15,20.","refs":[["Exod",7,15,7,15],["Exod",7,20,7,20]]},{"text":"Miraculous generation of frogs. — Ex 8:3.","refs":[["Exod",8,3,8,3]]}],"refCount":28}
